# between v1 and v2 on every axis (bench-results/2026-09-04-adaptive-k.md).
# Adaptive k, v3 thresholds (2026-09-04 09:46, owner: "testiamo anche la terza opzione"): seed of v1
# (every request starts at k=5) with the band of v2 (down 0.50 / up 0.60). v1 kept structured and
# four streams at the k=5 level but let prose hover (-4..-8%); v2 protected prose (42.7 in pass 2)
# but paid the k=3 start on every request (four streams 166-173 vs 225). v3 aims at both: prose
# (p3 0.39-0.48) drops below 0.50 within ~6 steps and stays down, structured never leaves 5.
